  "body_markdown": "About us\n\nmeet Dr. ChrisMeet The TeamLivewell DifferenceOffice TourTechnologyJoin Our Team\n\nservices\n\ndCOEFull Mouth ReconstructionSedation Dentistry\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nSmile MakeoverPorcelain VeneersNo Prep VeneersGum RecontouringTeeth WhiteningDental Bonding\n\nImplant Dentistry\n\nDental ImplantsSingle ImplantsImplant BridgesAll-on-X ImplantsLocator-Retained Dentures\n\nRestorative Dentistry\n\nDental CrownsInlays & OnlaysDental BridgesTooth-Colored Fillings\n\nOral Surgery\n\nBone GraftingRidge AugmentationTooth ExtractionSinus LiftWisdom Teeth Removal\n\nOrthodontics\n\nInvisalignBraces\n\nGeneral Dentistry\n\nPreventive DentistryPreventive CleaningGum TherapyRoot Canal Therapy\n\nTMJ TreatmentDental Emergencies\n\nnew patient\n\nfirst visit & new examInsurance & FinancingBlog\n\nOur work\n\nSmile GalleryTestimonials\n\nContact\n\ncall (703) 690-0102Request An Appointment\n\nBook Now\n\n703-690-0102\n\nLivewell Difference\n\nmeet Dr. Chris\n\nMeet The Team\n\nJoin Our Team\n\nOffice Tour\n\nTechnology\n\nServices\n\nFull Mouth Reconstruction\n\nDCOE\n\nTMJ Treatment\n\nDental Emergencies\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nPreventive\n\nDental Bridges\n\nRoot Canal\n\nProfessional Dental Cleaning\n\nScaling & Root Planing\n\nAll General Dentistry services\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nPorcelain Veneers\n\nNo Prep Veneers\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nGum Recontouring\n\nAll Cosmetic Dentistry Services\n\nSingle Implants\n\nImplant Bridges\n\nAll-on-X Implants\n\nLocator-Retained Dentures\n\nAll Implant Dentistry Services\n\nWisdom Teeth Removal\n\nTooth Extraction\n\nSinus Lift\n\nBone Grafting\n\nRidge Augmentation\n\nInvisalign\n\nBraces\n\nAll Orthodontics Services\n\nDental Crowns\n\nTooth-Colored Fillings\n\nDental Bonding\n\nInlays & Onlays\n\nAll Restorative Dentistry Services\n\nNew Patient\n\nfirst visit & new exam\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nBlog\n\nTestimonials\n\nSmile Gallery\n\nCALL US: (703) 690-0102\n\nBOOK AN APPOINTMENT\n\n320+\n\n5 Star Reviews\n\n\n# Cosmetic Dentistry in Fairfax Station, VA\n\n\nEvery case designed around your facial proportions\n\nResults designed to look natural, function well, and last\n\nStart-to-finish care with Dr. Chris, no handoffs to associates\n\n\n## Why Cosmetic Dentistry Here Is Different\n\n\nMost cosmetic dentistry focuses on making teeth look good. We focus on making them look good and function correctly for decades. A beautiful smile should not only look good on day one. It should feel comfortable, function properly, and be planned to hold up over time.\n\nAt Livewell, cosmetic cases start with diagnosis. We evaluate your bite, your jaw function, your facial proportions, and the health of your teeth and gums. Then we design a plan that solves the cosmetic concern and addresses the root cause. The result looks natural, feels comfortable, and lasts.\n\nWe treat cosmetic dentistry as precision work, not assembly line production\n\nEvery case is designed individually based on your anatomy and goals\n\nWe use conservative, tooth-preserving techniques whenever possible\n\nDr. Chris performs all cosmetic procedures personally from start to finish\n\nStart With a Full Evaluation\n\n\n## The Smile You Want Starts With Understanding Why You Don't Have It Already\n\n\nBook Your Evaluation\n\nWatch Now\n\nDr. Chris approaches cosmetic dentistry with a simple standard: if the work cannot be planned, explained, and supported long term, it should not be rushed. That standard shows up in the details patients often notice during care.\n\nTemporary restorations are carefully planned so the process feels smoother while your final result is being made.\n\nAnesthetic can be warmed before injection, one of many small details designed to make treatment feel more comfortable.\n\nEvery decision is weighed against long-term health, not just the fastest path to a cosmetic result.\n\n\n## Find the Right Solution for Your Smile\n\n\n\n### Porcelain Veneers\n\n\nThin ceramic shells that cover the front surface of teeth to improve shape, color, size, and symmetry. Veneers are more involved than bonding, but they are longer-lasting and more stain-resistant.\n\nBest for:\n\nTransforming multiple teeth\n\nachieving permanent color change\n\ncorrecting shape and alignment simultaneously.\n\nLearn More About Veneers\n\n\n### Dental Bonding\n\n\nComposite resin is sculpted directly onto the tooth to repair chips, close small gaps, or reshape edges. It is conservative, usually completed in one visit, and preserves natural tooth structure.\n\nSingle-tooth cosmetic issues\n\nsmall repairs\n\npatients who want to preserve natural tooth structure.\n\nLearn More About Bonding\n\n\n### Teeth Whitening\n\n\nProfessional whitening lightens the overall shade of your teeth and can improve stains that brushing alone cannot remove.\n\nHealthy teeth with yellowing or staining\n\nPatients who want a brighter smile without changing tooth shape\n\nSmile refreshes before veneers, bonding, or other cosmetic work\n\nLearn More About Whitening\n\n\n## Is Cosmetic Dentistry Right for You?\n\n\nYou've been hiding your smile in photos for years\n\nYour teeth are worn, chipped, stained, or uneven\n\nYou want a natural-looking result designed to last\n\nYou're willing to invest in quality over speed\n\nYour oral health is stable (no active decay or gum disease)\n\nYou want to restore your bite in a way that feels strong, cleanable, and natural\n\n\n## How Cosmetic Cases Work at Livewell\n\n\nCosmetic dentistry here follows a structured process designed to deliver results that last.\n\nComprehensive Evaluation\n\nWe start with our DCOE protocol. This includes clinical examination, digital imaging, bite analysis, and a conversation about what you want to achieve and why. We look at your teeth, your bite, your jaw function, and your facial proportions.\n\nDigital Smile Design\n\nBefore we touch your teeth, we create a digital preview of your result. You see what the final outcome will look like. We refine it together until the design matches your goals and works with your anatomy.\n\nTreatment Planning\n\nWe walk you through the recommended procedures, the timeline, and the investment required. You get a clear picture of what's involved before committing to anything.\n\nPrecision Execution\n\nDr. Chris performs all cosmetic work personally. No handoffs to associates or lab techs making decisions without seeing you. Every case gets individual attention and the time it needs to be done right.\n\nLong-Term Care\n\nWe follow up to make sure your results hold up. Cosmetic dentistry isn't fire-and-forget. We monitor your bite, check for wear, and address any issues early.\n\n\n## One Doctor. Your Entire Journey.\n\n\nDr. Chris is involved in every part of your cosmetic case at Livewell Dental. You will not be passed between providers, and you will not have someone new making decisions halfway through treatment. The same doctor who evaluates your smile, plans your design, and explains your options is the person guiding the final result.\n\nPersonalized Smile Design. Every case is planned around your face, bite, and goals.\n\nNo One-Size-Fits-All Approach. Veneers, bonding, whitening, and crowns are recommended only when they fit your needs.\n\nDigital Planning. Photos, scans, and previews help guide the final result.\n\nComfort-Focused Care. We explain each step and help you feel prepared before treatment begins.\n\nFully Documented. Photos and scans are tracked throughout your transformation.\n\n\n## The Technology Behind Your Smile Transformation\n\n\nExplore our technology\n\n\n### Digital Smile Design\n\n\nBefore starting any cosmetic case, we create a digital preview of your final result. You see what veneers, bonding, or crowns will look like on your face before we prep a single tooth. Changes happen on screen, not in your mouth.\n\n\n### eLab Digital Design Lab\n\n\nYour veneers and crowns are designed in-house using digital models of your teeth. Dr. Chris works directly with the lab technician to ensure shape, color, and fit match the plan. No outsourcing. Faster turnaround. Better results.\n\n\n### Intraoral Scanning\n\n\nWe capture precise digital impressions of your teeth without the gag-inducing trays full of impression material. The scanner maps your teeth in 3D, which means better-fitting restorations and a more comfortable experience for you.\n\n\n### PolarEyes Shade Matching\n\n\nMatching tooth color isn't guesswork here. PolarEyes captures the exact shade of your natural teeth under different lighting conditions so your veneers, bonding, or crowns blend seamlessly. What looks right in the office looks right everywhere else too.\n\n\n### Professional Studio Photography\n\n\nWe document your smile with professional-grade photos before, during, and after treatment. This helps us design your result, track progress, and show you the transformation. You get a clear record of where you started and where you ended up.\n\n\n### Dentofacial Analysis\n\n\nYour smile doesn't exist in isolation. We analyze how your teeth relate to your lips, your facial symmetry, and your overall proportions. Cosmetic work designed around your face looks natural. Cosmetic work designed in isolation looks like dentistry.\n\n\n## What Patients Say About Their Results\n\n\nWatch More Patient Stories\n\nHow long do cosmetic dental results last?\n\nIt depends on the procedure and how well you care for them. Porcelain veneers typically last 15 to 20 years or longer. Bonding lasts 5 to 10 years. Teeth whitening results fade over time and may need touch-ups every few years. Proper oral hygiene, avoiding hard foods, and addressing bite issues extend the lifespan of any cosmetic work.\n\nIs cosmetic dentistry covered by insurance?\n\nMost cosmetic procedures are not covered by dental insurance because they're considered elective. However, if a procedure is partly restorative (like a crown that fixes a broken tooth and improves appearance), insurance may cover a portion. We'll help you understand what's covered and provide financing options if needed.\n\nHow do I choose between veneers and bonding?\n\nIt varies widely depending on what's involved. A single veneer is very different from a full smile transformation with veneers, crowns, and gum contouring. We provide a detailed estimate during your consultation once we understand your goals and evaluate your case.\n\n\n### Common Questions About Cosmetic Dentistry\n\n\nContact Us\n\n\n### Reimagine your dental experience\n\n\n\n### address\n\n\n9027 Silverbrook Rd Ste. F\n\nFairfax Station, VA 22039\n\n\n### Contact\n\n\n\n### Hours\n\n\nMon-Tue: 8am-5pm\n\nWed-Thu: 8am-4pm\n\nFri: 8am-1pm\n\n\n### Connect\n\n\nServing Fairfax Station and the Greater Northern Virginia Area\n\nCopyright © TEXT-YEAR Livewell Dental\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nTerms of Service\n\nCookie Policy\n\nHIPAA Disclosure\n\nConsent Preferences",
